// Bundled Semantic IDE Queries, AXCODEEDITOR & `axiomc lsp` Driver Probe (T802 / E19.1)
// Exercises real `std.editor` + `compiler.query.db` + `compiler.lsp.protocol`
// + `compiler.lsp.vfs` + `compiler.lsp.handlers` + `compiler.driver.lsp_cmd`
// across `--interp`, `-O0`, `-O1`, and `-O2 --verify-each`.

